DATA_BLOCK "TON_RC_K1HOLD"
SFB      4
// v0.1 - NEW instance DB for SFB4 (IEC TON), replacing classical timer
// T53 (ReCalib_Step 2-4 - KILOTECK_Calib_K1 5s hold, inside the
// power-on+calibrate sequence). See DB106_TON_UNDERFILL.awl's header
// for the full reasoning. This is the one that most needed the SFB4
// fix: the classical design started T53 once in step 2 and only
// checked it again in step 4, two steps later - fine for a hardware
// timer, but SFB4 only advances while actually CALLed, so IN is now
// fed from "ReCalib_Step >= 2 AND <= 4", called every scan throughout
// that whole window - see FC155 v0.26.
BEGIN
END_DATA_BLOCK
